    <!-- ===================== VIP RESELLER — KREDENSIAL (WITHDRAW INSTAN) ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <i class="fas fa-link text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">VIP Reseller — Kredensial</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-3">Provider alternatif untuk withdraw instan (pilih "VIP Reseller" pada Provider di Metode Withdraw Instan). Ambil API ID &amp; API Key dari akun <a href="https://vip-reseller.co.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline font-medium">vip-reseller.co.id</a> (menu Profile). Signature dibuat otomatis: md5(API ID + API Key).</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">API ID</label>
          <input name="vipApiId" type="text" value="<%= settings.vipApiId || '' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500" placeholder="API ID VIP Reseller">
