        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Base URL API <span class="text-gray-400">(opsional, isi kalau berbeda dari default)</span></label>
          <input name="vipBaseUrl" type="text" value="<%= settings.vipBaseUrl || 'https://vip-reseller.co.id/api/prepaid' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500" placeholder="https://vip-reseller.co.id/api/prepaid">
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-3">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Webhook (opsional, status lebih cepat)</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 break-all">URL callback: <code class="font-bold"><%= typeof vipCallbackUrl !== 'undefined' ? vipCallbackUrl : 'https://DOMAIN-ANDA/webhook/vipreseller' %></code></p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Whitelist IP VIP Reseller <b>178.248.73.218</b>. Tanpa webhook pun status tetap dicek otomatis oleh sistem (polling).</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Callback memakai JSON dan header <code>X-Client-Signature</code> = md5(API ID + API Key). Status waiting/processing tetap pending, success selesai, error gagal.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-3">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">API Prepaid VIP Reseller</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 break-all">POST <code>https://vip-reseller.co.id/api/prepaid</code> dengan key, sign, dan type.</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Order: <code>type=order</code>, <code>service</code>, <code>data_no</code>. Cek status: <code>type=status</code> dan <code>trxid</code>. Daftar layanan: <code>type=services</code>, filter opsional type/brand.</p>
