          <p class="text-xs mt-2">Sesudah simpan: <a href="/admin/nokos/dibanana/balance" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cek saldo provider ↗</a> · <a href="/admin/nokos/dibanana/orders" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Riwayat provider ↗</a></p>
