            <input name="premkuMarkupPercent" type="number" min="0" value="<%= (typeof settings.premkuMarkupPercent === 'number' && !isNaN(settings.premkuMarkupPercent)) ? settings.premkuMarkupPercent : 15 %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Persentase keuntungan di atas harga asli premku.com sebelum dipotong dari saldo user. Contoh: harga asli Rp10.000, markup 15% &rarr; user membayar Rp11.500.</p>
