          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Markup Harga (%)</label>
          <input name="fayupediaMarkupPercent" type="number" min="0" value="<%= (typeof settings.fayupediaMarkupPercent === 'number' && !isNaN(settings.fayupediaMarkupPercent)) ? settings.fayupediaMarkupPercent : 20 %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Keuntungan di atas rate Heru Pedia (per 1000 unit) sebelum dipotong dari saldo user. Contoh: rate Rp10.000/1000, markup 20% &rarr; user membayar Rp12.000/1000.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 p-3 border-2 border-black rounded-2xl bg-white">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-800 mb-1">Cek Koneksi &amp; Layanan</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-2">Simpan pengaturan dulu, lalu klik tombol ini untuk melihat saldo panel (kalau tersedia), jumlah layanan, dan contoh harga. Boleh isi kata kunci (mis. <code>instagram</code>).</p>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <input id="sosmedDiagSearch" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="Kata kunci (opsional)" class="flex-1 min-w-0 bg-white border-2 border-black rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none">
          <button type="button" id="sosmedDiagBtn" class="shrink-0 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border-2 border-black" style="background:#facc15;color:#171717">CEK KONEKSI</button>
        </div>
        <pre id="sosmedDiagOut" class="hidden mt-2 p-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-black text-[11px] leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap" style="background:#fefce8;color:#171717"></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan Pengaturan Suntik Sosmed
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- ===================== JAM KERJA PENARIKAN ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-clock text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Jam Kerja Penarikan</h2>
        </div>
        <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" name="workHoursEnabled" id="workHoursEnabled" class="sr-only peer" <%= settings.workHoursEnabled ? "checked" : "" %>>
          <div class="w-10 h-5 bg-gray-200 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:bg-green-500 transition-colors after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:rounded-full after:h-4 after:w-4 after:transition-all peer-checked:after:translate-x-5"></div>
          <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-600" id="workHoursLabel"><%= settings.workHoursEnabled ? "Aktif" : "Nonaktif" %></span>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Jika aktif, penarikan manual & instan hanya bisa dilakukan pada jam dan hari yang ditentukan.</p>
      <div id="workHoursFields" class="<%= settings.workHoursEnabled ? '' : 'opacity-50 pointer-events-none' %> space-y-4">
        <!-- Jam Buka & Tutup -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">
              <i class="fas fa-door-open text-xs mr-1"></i>Jam Buka
            </label>
            <input type="time" name="workOpenTime" value="<%= settings.workOpenTime || '08:00' %>"
              class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">
              <i class="fas fa-door-closed text-xs mr-1"></i>Jam Tutup
            </label>
            <input type="time" name="workCloseTime" value="<%= settings.workCloseTime || '17:00' %>"
              class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Hari Buka & Tutup -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">
              <i class="fas fa-calendar-day text-xs mr-1"></i>Buka Hari
            </label>
            <select name="workOpenDay" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
              <% const hari = ['Minggu','Senin','Selasa','Rabu','Kamis','Jumat','Sabtu']; %>
              <% hari.forEach(function(h, i) { %>
                <option value="<%= i %>" <%= (settings.workOpenDay != null ? settings.workOpenDay : 1) == i ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= h %></option>
              <% }); %>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">
              <i class="fas fa-calendar-times text-xs mr-1"></i>Tutup Hari
            </label>
            <select name="workCloseDay" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
              <% hari.forEach(function(h, i) { %>
                <option value="<%= i %>" <%= (settings.workCloseDay != null ? settings.workCloseDay : 5) == i ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= h %></option>
              <% }); %>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Preview jadwal -->
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-info-circle text-blue-400"></i>
          <span>Penarikan tersedia: <strong id="workSchedulePreview"></strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Tombol simpan jam kerja -->
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-clock text-xs"></i> Simpan Jam Kerja
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== PILIH PROVIDER WITHDRAW INSTAN (VIP Reseller / FR3 / Austin) ===================== -->
    <div id="instantProviderSwitch" class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <i class="fas fa-random text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Pilih Provider Penarikan Instan</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-3">Pilih provider, lalu daftar metode di bawah otomatis berganti. Kalau provider itu belum punya metode, daftarnya kosong &mdash; buat dulu lalu <b>Simpan</b> (tersimpan di database MongoDB). <b>VIP Reseller &amp; FR3</b> = user memilih <b>nominal pilihan</b>. <b>Austin</b> = <b>nominal bebas</b> (beda sendiri).</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
        <button type="button" data-provider="vipreseller" class="instant-provider-tab px-2 py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-medium border transition-all">VIP Reseller<span class="block text-[10px] font-normal opacity-80 mt-0.5" data-count="vipreseller">0 metode</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-provider="fr3" class="instant-provider-tab px-2 py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-medium border transition-all">FR3 NEWERA<span class="block text-[10px] font-normal opacity-80 mt-0.5" data-count="fr3">0 metode</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-provider="austin" class="instant-provider-tab px-2 py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-medium border transition-all">Austin Pay<span class="block text-[10px] font-normal opacity-80 mt-0.5" data-count="austin">0 metode</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-provider="sekalipay" class="instant-provider-tab px-2 py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-medium border transition-all">Sekalipay<span class="block text-[10px] font-normal opacity-80 mt-0.5" data-count="sekalipay">0 metode</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-3">Provider aktif untuk user: <b id="instantActiveLabel">-</b></p>
      <button type="button" id="btnSaveActiveProvider" class="mt-3 w-full bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
        <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan Provider Aktif
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== METODE WITHDRAW INSTAN (H2H) ===================== -->
    <div id="metode-withdraw-instan" class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-bolt text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800" id="instantCardTitle">Metode Withdraw Instan — Nominal Pilihan</h2>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="btnAddInstantMethod" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-plus text-xs"></i><span id="btnAddInstantLabel">Metode Instan</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div id="instantMethodList" class="space-y-2 mb-3"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== METODE WITHDRAW INSTAN AUSTIN (BEBAS NOMINAL) — TERPISAH ===================== -->
    <div id="metode-withdraw-austin" class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-bolt text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Metode Withdraw Instan Austin Pay — Nominal Bebas</h2>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="btnAddAustinMethod" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-plus text-xs"></i>Metode Austin
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-3">Daftar ini terpisah dari FR3/VIP. User bebas mengetik nominal, dibatasi Min &amp; Max di bawah (seperti penarikan manual). Tiap metode dibuat &amp; disimpan sendiri.</p>
      <div id="austinMethodList" class="space-y-2 mb-3"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== METODE WITHDRAW INSTAN SEKALIPAY (BEBAS NOMINAL) — TERPISAH ===================== -->
    <div id="metode-withdraw-sekalipay" class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-bolt text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Metode Withdraw Instan Sekalipay — Nominal Bebas + Cek Nama</h2>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="btnAddSekalipayMethod" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-plus text-xs"></i>Metode Sekalipay
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-3">Satu metode = satu item <b>open denom</b> e-wallet di Sekalipay. User mengetik nominal (dibatasi Min &amp; Max), nomor tujuan dicek namanya dulu, lalu saldo dipotong. Tiap metode dibuat &amp; disimpan sendiri.</p>
      <div id="sekalipayMethodList" class="space-y-2 mb-3"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== SISTEM OTOMATISASI ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <i class="fas fa-cogs text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Sistem Otomatisasi</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <!-- Interval Cek Mutasi -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Interval Cek Mutasi (Detik)</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="checkInterval" type="number" value="<%= (typeof settings.checkInterval === 'number' && !isNaN(settings.checkInterval)) ? settings.checkInterval : 20 %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Kedaluwarsa QRIS -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Kedaluwarsa QRIS (Menit)</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="qrisExpiredMinutes" type="number" value="<%= (typeof settings.qrisExpiredMinutes === 'number' && !isNaN(settings.qrisExpiredMinutes)) ? settings.qrisExpiredMinutes : 30 %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" required>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Tombol simpan khusus card ini -->
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan Otomatisasi
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== TELEGRAM BOT ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <i class="fab fa-telegram-plane text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Telegram Bot</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="cm-bot-controls" id="telegramBotControls" data-state="checking">
        <div class="cm-bot-heading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="cm-bot-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span id="botStatusText">Memeriksa status bot…</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cm-bot-actions" aria-label="Kontrol bot Telegram">
          <button type="button" id="botOnBtn" data-bot-action="on" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v9m-5-7a9 9 0 1 0 10 0"/></svg> ON</button>
          <button type="button" id="botOffBtn" data-bot-action="off" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="3"/></svg> OFF</button>
          <button type="button" id="restartBotBtn" data-bot-action="restart"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5M5 8a8 8 0 0 1 14-2l1 6M4 12l1 6a8 8 0 0 0 14-2"/></svg> Restart</button>
        </div>
        <p id="botControlMessage" class="cm-bot-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p class="cm-bot-help">ON / Restart menyimpan Token dan Owner ID di bawah. OFF tetap bisa dipakai tanpa mengisi token. Status diperbarui otomatis.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <!-- Token Bot -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Token Bot</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="telegramBotToken" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" spellcheck="false" value="<%= settings.telegramBotToken %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="Masukkan token dari @BotFather">
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Owner ID -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Owner ID (ID Telegram Anda)</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="telegramOwnerId" type="text" value="<%= settings.telegramOwnerId %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="Contoh: 123456789">
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- ID Group CS Bantuan (Tiket) -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">ID Group CS Bantuan (Tiket)</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="telegramTicketGroupId" type="text" value="<%= settings.telegramTicketGroupId %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="Contoh: -1001234567890 (kosongkan = ke Owner ID)">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">
            Notifikasi Tiket CS Bantuan dari user dikirim ke group ini, bukan ke chat pribadi Owner, supaya semua staf CS di group bisa saling bantu balas. Balas (reply) pesan notifikasi tiket di group ini untuk membalas ke user. Kosongkan untuk pakai perilaku lama (ke chat pribadi Owner ID).
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Nama Bot -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Nama Bot</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="telegramBotName" type="text" value="<%= settings.telegramBotName %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="Contoh: Nexapay Bot (kosongkan = pakai Nama Website)">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Nama yang ditampilkan bot saat menyapa user (perintah /start).</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Foto bersama untuk pesan bot dan notifikasi channel -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Foto Bot (URL Gambar)</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="telegramStartPhotoUrl" type="text" value="<%= settings.telegramStartPhotoUrl %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="https://example.com/pp-bot.jpg">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">URL gambar langsung yang bisa diakses publik (.jpg/.png). Dipakai untuk /start, menu, profil bot, serta notifikasi member baru dan transaksi di channel. Klik Simpan Pengaturan Bot untuk menerapkan ke pesan berikutnya. Kosongkan untuk pesan tanpa foto.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- URL Profil untuk pendaftaran ID Telegram -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">URL Halaman Profil</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="telegramProfileUrl" type="text" value="<%= settings.telegramProfileUrl %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="https://app.nevapedia.com/profile">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Link halaman website (bukan gambar) untuk tombol "Buka Halaman Profil" yang muncul saat user belum terdaftar.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Enabled (hidden) -->
        <input type="hidden" name="telegramBotEnabled" id="telegramBotEnabledInput" value="<%= settings.telegramBotEnabled ? 'on' : '' %>">
      </div>

      <!-- Tombol simpan -->
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan Pengaturan Bot
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== KONFIGURASI SMTP EMAIL ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <i class="fas fa-envelope text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Konfigurasi SMTP Email</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <!-- Email Gmail -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Email Gmail</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="smtpUser" type="email" value="<%= settings.smtpUser %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="emailanda@gmail.com">
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- App Password -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">App Password</label>
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input name="smtpPass" type="text" value="<%= settings.smtpPass %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="16 karakter App Password">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1.5">Gunakan App Password dari Google, bukan password login biasa.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Tombol simpan khusus card ini -->
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan SMTP
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== VERIFIKASI REGISTRASI ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-user-shield text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Verifikasi Registrasi</h2>
        </div>
        <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" name="registerVerificationEnabled" id="registerVerificationEnabled" class="sr-only peer" <%= settings.registerVerificationEnabled ? "checked" : "" %>>
          <div class="w-10 h-5 bg-gray-200 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:bg-green-500 transition-colors after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:rounded-full after:h-4 after:w-4 after:transition-all peer-checked:after:translate-x-5"></div>
          <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-600" id="registerVerificationLabel"><%= settings.registerVerificationEnabled ? "Aktif" : "Nonaktif" %></span>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
        Jika <strong>Aktif</strong>, user baru wajib memverifikasi kode OTP yang dikirim ke email (Gmail) yang didaftarkan sebelum akunnya benar-benar dibuat.
        Jika <strong>Nonaktif</strong>, registrasi langsung jadi tanpa verifikasi apa pun.
        User bisa memilih <strong>2 metode</strong>: <strong>Verifikasi Nomor WhatsApp</strong> (butuh WhatsApp Sender tertaut di bawah) atau <strong>Verifikasi Gmail</strong> (butuh Konfigurasi SMTP Email di atas).
        Metode yang konfigurasinya masih kosong tampil nonaktif di halaman registrasi.
      </p>

      <!-- ===== WhatsApp Sender (Baileys) ===== -->
      <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp mr-1" style="color:#25D366"></i>WhatsApp Sender (pengirim OTP)</label>
          <span id="waBadge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-500">
            <span id="waDot" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300"></span><span id="waBadgeText">Memuat...</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div id="waFormArea">
          <div class="flex items-center bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 p-1.5 transition-all focus-within:border-gray-500 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-gray-500">
            <input id="waNumberInput" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" value="<%= settings.waSenderNumber || '' %>" class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none w-full" placeholder="Nomor sender + kode negara, contoh: 628123456789">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1.5">Nomor WhatsApp yang akan mengirim OTP ke user. Klik Tautkan Perangkat, lalu masukkan kode yang muncul.</p>
          <button type="button" id="waPairBtn" class="mt-3 w-full px-3 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium text-white shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2" style="background:#25D366">
            <i class="fas fa-link text-xs"></i> <span id="waPairBtnText">Tautkan Perangkat</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Kode pairing -->
        <div id="waCodeBox" class="hidden mt-3 rounded-2xl border p-4 text-center" style="border-color:#bbf7d0;background:#f0fdf4">
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-1">Kode perangkat kamu</p>
          <p id="waCodeText" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-widest text-gray-800 select-all">----</p>
          <button type="button" id="waCopyBtn" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border-2 border-black bg-white text-gray-800 shadow-[2px_2px_0_#14120f] active:translate-y-[1px] active:shadow-none transition-all">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> <span id="waCopyBtnText">Salin Kode</span>
          </button>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Buka WhatsApp di nomor sender &rarr; <b>Perangkat Tertaut</b> &rarr; <b>Tautkan Perangkat</b> &rarr; <b>Tautkan dengan nomor telepon</b>, lalu masukkan kode di atas. Halaman ini otomatis berubah saat tersambung.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p id="waError" class="hidden mt-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-red-600"></p>

        <!-- Sudah tersambung -->
        <div id="waConnectedBox" class="hidden mt-1 rounded-2xl border p-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3" style="border-color:#bbf7d0;background:#f0fdf4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800">Sender tersambung</p>
            <p id="waConnectedNumber" class="text-[11px] text-gray-500"></p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" id="waLogoutBtn" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium text-white bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 transition-all">Putuskan</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan Verifikasi
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===================== AI ASSISTANT (Groq) ===================== -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-5 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <i class="fas fa-robot text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">AI Assistant (Groq)</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mb-3">AI tampil sebagai menu biasa (<b>/ai</b>), dengan model Groq. User memilih model sendiri dari daftar di bawah, bisa upload ZIP dokumentasi &amp; gambar, dan dapat saran chat otomatis. Dokumentasi: <a href="https://console.groq.com/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline">console.groq.com/docs</a></p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-800">Aktifkan Menu AI</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Nonaktif = menu AI disembunyikan &amp; bot Telegram/WhatsApp AI berhenti.</p>
          </div>
          <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
            <input type="checkbox" name="aiBubbleEnabled" class="sr-only peer" <%= settings.aiBubbleEnabled ? "checked" : "" %>>
            <div class="w-9 h-5 bg-gray-200 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:bg-blue-500 after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:rounded-full after:h-4 after:w-4 after:transition-all peer-checked:after:translate-x-4"></div>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3">
          <div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-800">Balas chat Telegram dengan AI</p><p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Pakai model default di bawah.</p></div>
          <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
            <input type="checkbox" name="aiBubbleTelegramEnabled" class="sr-only peer" <%= settings.aiBubbleTelegramEnabled ? "checked" : "" %>>
            <div class="w-9 h-5 bg-gray-200 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:bg-blue-500 after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:rounded-full after:h-4 after:w-4 after:transition-all peer-checked:after:translate-x-4"></div>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3">
          <div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-800">Balas chat WhatsApp dengan AI</p><p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Pakai model default di bawah.</p></div>
          <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
            <input type="checkbox" name="aiBubbleWhatsappEnabled" class="sr-only peer" <%= settings.aiBubbleWhatsappEnabled ? "checked" : "" %>>
            <div class="w-9 h-5 bg-gray-200 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:bg-blue-500 after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:rounded-full after:h-4 after:w-4 after:transition-all peer-checked:after:translate-x-4"></div>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Base URL API</label>
          <input name="aiApiBaseUrl" type="text" value="<%= settings.aiApiBaseUrl || 'https://api.groq.com/openai/v1' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3 text-xs font-medium outline-none" placeholder="https://api.groq.com/openai/v1">
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">OpenAI-compatible. Cukup isi <code>https://api.groq.com</code>, otomatis jadi <code>/openai/v1</code>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">API Key</label>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <input id="aiApiKeyInput" name="aiApiKey" type="password" value="<%= settings.aiApiKey || '' %>" autocomplete="off" class="flex-1 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3 text-xs font-medium outline-none" placeholder="gsk_...">
            <button type="button" id="aiToggleKeyBtn" class="shrink-0 px-3 py-3 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700"><i class="fas fa-eye text-xs"></i></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Daftar Model yang Bisa Dipilih User (satu per baris)</label>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <button type="button" id="aiLoadModelsBtn" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fas fa-cloud-arrow-down text-xs"></i> Ambil dari Groq</button>
              <input id="aiModelSearch" type="text" placeholder="Cari model (mis. llama, gpt-oss)" class="hidden flex-1 min-w-0 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl shadow-sm px-3 py-2 text-xs outline-none">
            </div>
            <div id="aiModelResults" class="hidden mt-2 max-h-48 overflow-y-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-100 divide-y divide-gray-100"></div>
          </div>
          <textarea id="aiModelsInput" name="aiModels" rows="6" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3 text-xs font-medium outline-none font-mono"><%= settings.aiModels || '' %></textarea>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Pakai ID model Groq, misalnya <code>llama-3.3-70b-versatile</code> atau <code>llama-3.1-8b-instant</code>. Cari di <a href="https://console.groq.com/docs/models" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline">console.groq.com/docs/models</a> atau isi API key lalu klik Ambil dari Groq. Model yang tersedia mengikuti akses akun; periksa dukungan gambar di dokumentasi model. Model teks tidak dapat membaca gambar.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Model Default</label>
          <input id="aiDefaultModelInput" name="aiDefaultModel" type="text" value="<%= settings.aiDefaultModel || 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3 text-xs font-medium outline-none font-mono">
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Terpilih awal di menu AI, dan dipakai bot Telegram/WhatsApp. Harus ada di daftar model.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button type="button" id="aiTestBtn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fas fa-plug text-xs"></i> Tes Koneksi</button>
        </div>
        <p id="aiTestResult" class="hidden text-[11px] font-medium rounded-xl px-3 py-2"></p>

        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-gray-100"><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800">Bola AI Melayang (Gelombang)</p><p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Bola tetap tampil di semua halaman. Balasannya sekarang lewat Groq (model default di atas).</p></div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Nama Asisten</label>
          <input name="aiBubbleName" type="text" maxlength="40" value="<%= settings.aiBubbleName || 'AI Assistant' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500" placeholder="AI Assistant">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Posisi Bola</label>
          <select name="aiBubblePosition" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
            <option value="right" <%= settings.aiBubblePosition !== 'left' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Kanan bawah</option>
            <option value="left" <%= settings.aiBubblePosition === 'left' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Kiri bawah</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Template Bingkai Bola</label>
          <select id="aiBubbleFrameSelect" name="aiBubbleFrameStyle" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
            <option value="animation" <%= settings.aiBubbleFrameStyle !== 'comic' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Animasi — pakai video custom (.mp4)</option>
            <option value="comic" <%= settings.aiBubbleFrameStyle === 'comic' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Komik — bingkai tebal ala komik, tanpa video</option>
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">"Animasi" menampilkan video di URL animasi bola di bawah. "Komik" menampilkan bingkai bola bertema komik (border tebal, shadow keras) mengikuti tema situs — video tidak dipakai di mode ini.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Ukuran Bola: <span id="aiBubbleSizeVal"><%= settings.aiBubbleSize || 60 %></span>px</label>
          <input id="aiBubbleSizeInput" name="aiBubbleSize" type="range" min="40" max="110" step="2" value="<%= settings.aiBubbleSize || 60 %>" class="w-full accent-blue-500">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1"><span>Kecil (40px)</span><span>Besar (110px)</span></div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div id="aiBubbleSizePreview" class="rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 border-2" style="width:<%= settings.aiBubbleSize || 60 %>px;height:<%= settings.aiBubbleSize || 60 %>px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--comic-red,#ef2b2d),var(--comic-red-dark,#b91c1c));border-color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.2)">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-robot text-white"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Preview ukuran bola (bentuk asli mengikuti template bingkai yang dipilih).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Ukuran Popup Chat</label>
          <select name="aiBubblePopupSize" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500">
            <option value="compact" <%= settings.aiBubblePopupSize === 'compact' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Kecil (compact)</option>
            <option value="normal" <%= (!settings.aiBubblePopupSize || settings.aiBubblePopupSize === 'normal') ? 'selected' : '' %>>Sedang (normal)</option>
            <option value="large" <%= settings.aiBubblePopupSize === 'large' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Besar (large)</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div id="aiBubbleAnimField">
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">URL Video Animasi Bola (.mp4) <span class="text-gray-400">(opsional)</span></label>
          <input id="aiBubbleAnimInput" name="aiBubbleAnimationUrl" type="text" value="<%= settings.aiBubbleAnimationUrl || '' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500" placeholder="https://contoh.com/animasi-bola.mp4">
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Video akan diputar loop tanpa suara di dalam bola (bentuk lingkaran). Kalau dikosongkan, dipakai animasi gradient bawaan.</p>
          <div class="mt-3">
            <% if (settings.aiBubbleAnimationUrl) { %>
              <video id="aiBubbleAnimPreview" src="<%= settings.aiBubbleAnimationUrl %>" autoplay loop muted playsinline class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-gray-100 shadow-sm"></video>
            <% } else { %>
              <video id="aiBubbleAnimPreview" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-gray-100 shadow-sm hidden" autoplay loop muted playsinline></video>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Pesan Sambutan Pertama</label>
          <input name="aiBubbleGreeting" type="text" maxlength="300" value="<%= settings.aiBubbleGreeting || '' %>" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:border-gray-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500" placeholder="Halo! Ada yang bisa saya bantu?">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Saran Chat Otomatis (satu per baris)</label>
          <textarea name="aiSuggestions" rows="4" maxlength="1000" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3 text-xs font-medium outline-none"><%= settings.aiSuggestions || '' %></textarea>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Tombol saran di menu AI; sekali tap langsung terkirim. Saran khusus akun (mis. <i>"Saldo saya tertahan…"</i> saat user punya saldo tertahan) muncul otomatis.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">System Prompt (Kepribadian &amp; Batasan AI)</label>
          <textarea name="aiBubbleSystemPrompt" rows="4" maxlength="4000" class="w-full bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-3 text-xs font-medium outline-none"><%= settings.aiBubbleSystemPrompt || '' %></textarea>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1.5">Dikirim ke AI di setiap percakapan (tidak terlihat user). Data saldo &amp; transaksi user ditambahkan otomatis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white w-full px-3 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-save text-xs"></i> Simpan Pengaturan AI
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </form>

  <script>
  (function () {
    var key = document.getElementById('aiApiKeyInput'), tg = document.getElementById('aiToggleKeyBtn');
    if (key && tg) tg.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var show = key.type === 'password'; key.type = show ? 'text' : 'password';
      tg.innerHTML = '<i class="fas ' + (show ? 'fa-eye-slash' : 'fa-eye') + ' text-xs"></i>';
    });
        var loadBtn = document.getElementById('aiLoadModelsBtn'), search = document.getElementById('aiModelSearch'), results = document.getElementById('aiModelResults'), ta = document.getElementById('aiModelsInput');
    var allModels = [];
    function esc(s) { return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, function (c) { return { '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#39;' }[c]; }); }
    function renderModels() {
      var q = (search.value || '').toLowerCase().trim();
      var list = allModels.filter(function (m) { return !q || m.id.toLowerCase().indexOf(q) >= 0 || m.name.toLowerCase().indexOf(q) >= 0; }).slice(0, 40);
      results.innerHTML = list.length ? '' : '<p class="p-3 text-[11px] text-gray-500">Tidak ada hasil.</p>';
      list.forEach(function (m) {
        var b = document.createElement('button'); b.type = 'button';
        b.className = 'w-full text-left px-3 py-2 text-[11.5px] hover:bg-gray-50';
        b.innerHTML = '<span class="font-mono font-semibold">' + esc(m.id) + '</span> ' + '<br><span class="text-gray-500">' + esc(m.name) + '</span>';
        b.onclick = function () {
          var cur = ta.value.split(/\n+/).map(function (x) { return x.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);
          if (cur.indexOf(m.id) < 0) cur.push(m.id);
          ta.value = cur.join('\n');
        };
        results.appendChild(b);
      });
    }
    if (loadBtn) loadBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var old = loadBtn.innerHTML; loadBtn.disabled = true; loadBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin text-xs"></i> Memuat...';
      var f = document.querySelector('[name="aiApiBaseUrl"]');
      fetch('/admin/ai/models', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ aiApiBaseUrl: f ? f.value : '', aiApiKey: key.value }) })
        .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
        .then(function (d) {
          if (!d.success) { alert(d.message || 'Gagal memuat model.'); return; }
          allModels = d.models; search.classList.remove('hidden'); results.classList.remove('hidden'); renderModels();
        })
        .catch(function () { alert('Gagal menghubungi server.'); })
        .finally(function () { loadBtn.disabled = false; loadBtn.innerHTML = old; });
    });
    if (search) search.addEventListener('input', renderModels);
    var btn = document.getElementById('aiTestBtn'), out = document.getElementById('aiTestResult');
    if (btn && out) btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var old = btn.innerHTML; btn.disabled = true; btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin text-xs"></i> Menguji...';
      var f = document.querySelector('[name="aiApiBaseUrl"]');
      fetch('/admin/ai/test', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ aiApiKey: key.value, aiApiBaseUrl: f ? f.value : '', aiDefaultModel: document.getElementById('aiDefaultModelInput').value }) })
        .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
        .then(function (d) {
          out.className = 'text-[11px] font-medium rounded-xl px-3 py-2 ' + (d.success ? 'bg-green-50 text-green-700' : 'bg-red-50 text-red-700');
          out.textContent = d.message + (d.reply ? ' — balasan: "' + d.reply + '"' : '');
        })
        .catch(function () { out.className = 'text-[11px] font-medium rounded-xl px-3 py-2 bg-red-50 text-red-700'; out.textContent = 'Gagal menghubungi server.'; })
        .finally(function () { btn.disabled = false; btn.innerHTML = old; });
    });
    var animInput = document.getElementById('aiBubbleAnimInput');
    var animPreview = document.getElementById('aiBubbleAnimPreview');
    if (animInput && animPreview) {
      animInput.addEventListener('input', function () {
        var url = animInput.value.trim();
        if (url) {
          animPreview.src = url;
          animPreview.classList.remove('hidden');
        } else {
          animPreview.removeAttribute('src');
          animPreview.classList.add('hidden');
        }
      });
    }

    // ---- Ukuran bola: slider + preview langsung ----
    var sizeInput = document.getElementById('aiBubbleSizeInput');
    var sizeVal = document.getElementById('aiBubbleSizeVal');
    var sizePreview = document.getElementById('aiBubbleSizePreview');
    if (sizeInput) {
      sizeInput.addEventListener('input', function () {
        var px = sizeInput.value + 'px';
        if (sizeVal) sizeVal.textContent = sizeInput.value;
        if (sizePreview) { sizePreview.style.width = px; sizePreview.style.height = px; }
      });
    }

    // ---- Template bingkai: sembunyikan field URL animasi kalau mode "komik" dipilih,
    // dan ganti tampilan preview bola supaya admin lihat gambaran bingkai komik ----
    var frameSelect = document.getElementById('aiBubbleFrameSelect');
    var animField = document.getElementById('aiBubbleAnimField');
    function applyFramePreview() {
      var isComic = frameSelect && frameSelect.value === 'comic';
      if (animField) animField.style.display = isComic ? 'none' : '';
      if (sizePreview) {
        if (isComic) {
          sizePreview.style.background = 'var(--comic-yellow, #ffd400)';
          sizePreview.style.border = '3px solid var(--comic-black, #14120f)';
          sizePreview.style.boxShadow = '3px 3px 0 var(--comic-black, #14120f)';
          sizePreview.style.borderRadius = '50%';
          sizePreview.innerHTML = '<i class="fa-solid fa-comment-dots" style="color:var(--comic-black,#14120f)"></i>';
        } else {
          sizePreview.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg,var(--comic-red,#ef2b2d),var(--comic-red-dark,#b91c1c))';
          sizePreview.style.border = '2px solid #fff';
          sizePreview.style.boxShadow = '0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.2)';
          sizePreview.style.borderRadius = '50%';
          sizePreview.innerHTML = '<i class="fa-solid fa-robot text-white"></i>';
        }
      }
    }
    if (frameSelect) {
      frameSelect.addEventListener('change', applyFramePreview);
      applyFramePreview();
    }

  })();
  </script>

  <!-- ===================== ZONA BERBAHAYA — RESET DATABASE ===================== -->
  <div class="bg-white border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-red-100">
      <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-gray-700 text-sm"></i>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Zona Berbahaya</h2>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Pengaturan di bawah ini akan berdampak fatal pada data Anda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between bg-red-50/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-red-100 gap-3">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-medium text-red-600">Reset Database</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-500 mt-1 max-w-xl">Menghapus permanen semua data pengguna, invoice, transaksi, dan withdrawal. Data admin & pengaturan tidak akan terhapus.</p>
      </div>
      <form action="/admin/settings/reset" method="POST" 
            onsubmit="var answer = prompt('Ketik RESET untuk melanjutkan reset database:'); 
                      if (answer !== 'RESET') { 
                        alert('Reset dibatalkan. Anda harus mengetik RESET dengan benar.'); 
                        return false; 
                      } 
                      return confirm('⚠️ PERINGATAN TERAKHIR!\n\nApakah Anda yakin ingin mereset database?\nSemua data pengguna, invoice, transaksi, dan withdrawal akan DIHAPUS PERMANEN.\nData admin & pengaturan TIDAK akan terhapus.\n\nKlik OK untuk melanjutkan atau Batal.');">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 text-white w-full md:w-auto px-5 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium shadow-sm transition-all inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap">
          <i class="fas fa-trash-alt text-xs"></i> Reset Database
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===================== MODAL METODE WITHDRAW MANUAL ===================== -->
<div id="methodModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[150] hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity" onclick="hideModal()"></div>
  <div class="relative bg-white border-[3px] border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(20,18,15,1)] w-full max-w-sm transform transition-all scale-95 opacity-0 duration-200 rounded-2xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden" id="modalContent">
    <div class="bg-comic-yellow px-5 py-4 relative flex items-center justify-between border-b-[3px] border-black shrink-0" style="background: var(--comic-yellow);">
      <h3 class="font-comic text-lg tracking-wide text-black" id="modalTitle">TAMBAH METODE WITHDRAW MANUAL</h3>
      <button type="button" id="btnCloseModal" class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-black text-black font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shrink-0">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="p-5 overflow-y-auto flex-1">
      <form id="methodForm" class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <input type="hidden" id="editIndex" value="-1">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">Nama Metode</label>
          <input type="text" id="methodName" class="w-full bg-white border-2 border-black rounded-2xl px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-400" placeholder="Contoh: Dana" required>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">Biaya Admin (Rp)</label>
          <input type="number" id="methodFee" class="w-full bg-white border-2 border-black rounded-2xl px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-400" placeholder="1000" min="0" required>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">Minimal Penarikan (Rp)</label>
          <input type="number" id="methodMin" class="w-full bg-white border-2 border-black rounded-2xl px-3 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-400" placeholder="0" min="0" value="0" required>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pt-2">
          <button type="button" id="btnCancelModal" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold text-black bg-white border-2 border-black hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">Batal</button>
          <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold text-white bg-blue-500 border-2 border-black shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(20,18,15,1)] hover:shadow-[1px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(20,18,15,1)] hover:translate-x-[2px] hover:translate-y-[2px] transition-all">Simpan</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===================== MODAL METODE WITHDRAW INSTAN ===================== -->
<div id="instantMethodModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[150] hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity" onclick="hideInstantModal()"></div>
  <div class="relative bg-white border-[3px] border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(20,18,15,1)] w-full max-w-sm transform transition-all scale-95 opacity-0 duration-200 rounded-2xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden" id="instantModalContent">
    <div class="bg-comic-yellow px-5 py-4 relative flex items-center justify-between border-b-[3px] border-black shrink-0" style="background: var(--comic-yellow);">
      <h3 class="font-comic text-lg tracking-wide text-black" id="instantModalTitle">TAMBAH METODE WITHDRAW INSTAN</h3>
      <button type="button" id="btnCloseInstantModal" class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-black text-black font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shrink-0">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="p-5 overflow-y-auto flex-1">
      <form id="instantMethodForm" class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <input type="hidden" id="instantEditIndex" value="-1">
